<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29587" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύσφημ-ος</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσφήμ-φᾱμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of
				ill omen, boding</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				735
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔφημος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				1144
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Hp.Ma.</u>
				293a
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μως</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἱερουργεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Zen.
					4.95
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>slanderous, shameful</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					307
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					715
				</span></i>
			; <i>abusive</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Luc.</u>
				18
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μως</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				<u>PS</u>
				p.62
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>of ill fame, evil</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλέος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					8.37
				</span></i>
			.</div>
